 artifact EV-DPROF-00105 is impaired — weight 0.75, issue STALE_SNAPSHOT, its snapshot being 108 hours before filing against a 72-hour threshold — and I name it as POL-GEN-02(3) requires. The finding survives the discount: 4 clears the threshold of 3 even on a lagged snapshot. The impairment's only effect is to cap my confidence at 0.75, which remains above the 0.70 escalation floor, so the ruling issues rather than escalating. I did not use the lifetime prior_deviation_flags counter or the driver's rating.\n\nThe case is additionally referred to driver-conduct review under POL-RD-06(c); that referral rides with the refund and does not delay it."
